  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rahul vs State on 26 September, 2016 Author: Pankaj Bhandari Bench: Pankaj Bhandari 1/3 In The High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur ----------------- ------------- S.B.Cri. Misc. Bail Appl. No.8793/2016 Petitioner Rahul Pareek s/o Shri Nityanand Pareek, By caste Pareek, Age 37 years, R/o Songiri Kuan, Bikaner. (Presently lodged at Central Jail, Bikaner) Versus Respondent State of Rajasthan Date of order : 26.09.2016 Hon'Ble Mr.Justice Pankaj Bhandari Mr.S.D.Purohit for the petitioner. Mr.K.V.Vyas, Pp for the State. <> < > <> Order 1.",
    "facts": "The petitioner has moved this bail application under Section 439 Cr.P.C. 2. The allegation in this FIR pertains to offences under Sections 420 and 272 IPC and Section 63 of the Copyright Act, 1957 and Section 50 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. The contention of counsel for the petitioner is that the FIR has been lodged by Pushpendra Singh, Constable, Police Station Bichhwal, who is not authorized to do so under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is also contended that the present petitioner is having all the relevant certificates and permissions to run his factory.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. The contention of counsel for the petitioner is that the FIR has been lodged by Pushpendra Singh, Constable, Police Station Bichhwal, who is not authorized to do so under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is also contended that the present petitioner is having all the relevant certificates and permissions to run his factory.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
